CompileFlags:
  CompilationDatabase: build/default
  Add:
    - -std=c11
    - -I@CMAKE_SOURCE_DIR@/libs/vtx_core/include
    - -I@CMAKE_SOURCE_DIR@/libs/vtx_compiler/include
    - -I@CMAKE_SOURCE_DIR@/libs/vtx_stdlib/include
    - -I@CMAKE_SOURCE_DIR@/libs/vtx_vm/include
    - -I@CMAKE_SOURCE_DIR@/libs/vtx_jit/include
    - -I@CMAKE_SOURCE_DIR@/tools/vtx_cli/include
